OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal to find man after his
OL,4,Achildren go missing
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are appealing for help to locate
OL,7,Fa wanted man after his two children
OL,8,Fwere reported missing.
OL,10,FWest Yorkshire Police are looking for
OL,11,F42-year-old Kibriya Ahmed, following
OL,12,Freports his two sons, Yousaf, 15, and
OL,13,FMohammed, 12, have not been seen since
OL,14,Fthe weekend.
OL,16,FAhmed is wanted on suspicion of
OL,17,Fbreaching a non-molestation order which
OL,18,Fprevents him from having unsupervised
OL,19,Fcontact with his children.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
