OL,4,Achildren go missing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA force spokesperson said: "Officers
OL,7,Fbelieve Ahmed may know the whereabouts
OL,8,Fof his two children and have conducted
OL,9,Fextensive arrest inquiries in order to
OL,10,Ftry and locate him but are now
OL,11,Fappealing for the public's help."
